ect-heat-delivery-no-electrical-reconversion-which-can-plausibly-exceed-85-electricity-to-delivered-heat-efficiency-the-original-claim-overreaches-by-applying-electrical-round-trip-language-to-a-systemtemperature-window-pairing-that-only-supports-one-of-these-two-narrower-different-claims)508 0 R(dead-end-charitable-reading-of-the-claim-as-a-thermal-only-retention-efficiency)512 0 R(dead-end-heat-pump-assisted-charging-to-boost-round-trip-efficiency-above-the-simple-multiplicative-bound)511 0 R(dead-end-naive-carnot-calculation-using-the-salts-290c-return-temperature-as-the-cold-reservoir)510 0 R(executive-summary)498 0 R(molten-salt-thermal-storage-round-trip-efficiency-claim)497 0 R]>>>>>>
